97/ss_525f30461ff05847bf98a1b771676196eeb94b97.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768399485","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549310/525f30461ff05847bf98a1b771676196eeb94b97/ss_525f30461ff05847bf98a1b771676196eeb94b97.600x338.jpg?t=1768399485"}],"short_description":"Magic Madness VR is an immersive elemental PvP arena where every motion is magic and every spell is a choice. Battle up to four players in fast, skill-based VR combat, mastering Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, and Water across evolving arenas that test balance, reflex, and true elemental control.","steam_appid":3549310,"support_info":{"email":"feedback@magicmadnessvr.com","url":"https://www.magicmadnessvr.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.magicmadnessvr.com/"}